# Reproducibility across platforms (W-REPRO). The integrity gates hash files byte-for-byte (frozen baseline, bundle
# freshness, golden fixtures, Factory pins). A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrote LF to CRLF and broke
# them (proven: general Node 123/125, GFPI 164/171, frozen drift, stale bundles). Every text file is stored and checked
# out with LF regardless of local Git settings; the index already holds LF for all text files, so no content changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary evidence and assets: never normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.bundle binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
